OL,3,GNEWSACoventry City back on MOTD after a
OL,4,A25-year hiatus
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe last time Coventry City featured on
OL,7,FMatch of the Day (MOTD), the BBC's
OL,8,Fround-up of top flight English
OL,9,Ffootball, was 19 May 2001.
OL,11,FThe week before, the club's relegation
OL,12,Ffrom the Premier League had been
OL,13,Fconfirmed with a 3-2 defeat by Aston
OL,14,FVilla at Villa Park.
OL,16,FHowever, after 25 years, the Sky Blues
OL,17,Fare back - and that means regular
OL,18,Fappearances on MOTD.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
