OL,3,GNEWSACoventry City back on MOTD after a
OL,4,A25-year hiatus
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC CWR breakfast show presenter Lorna
OL,7,FBailey visited the programme's studios
OL,8,Fto find out what goes on behind the
OL,9,Fscenes, how it all comes together, and
OL,10,Fto speak to host Gabby Logan, who grew
OL,11,Fup in Coventry when her father, Terry
OL,12,FYorath, played for the city.
